@startuml Hybrid V2 Model - Simplified View

title Hybrid V2 Model Architecture\nSimplified Component Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

rectangle "Input" as Input #LightBlue {
  [Image\n224×224×3]
}

rectangle "ResNet50 Backbone" as ResNet #LightGreen {
  [Feature Extractor]
  [Global Avg Pool]
  [2048 features]
}

rectangle "EfficientNet-B0 Backbone" as EfficientNet #LightYellow {
  [Feature Extractor]
  [Global Avg Pool]
  [1280 features]
}

rectangle "Fusion Module" as Fusion #LightCoral {
  [Concatenate\n3328 dims]
  [Linear: 3328→512]
  [LayerNorm]
  [ReLU + Dropout(0.3)]
}

rectangle "Classifier" as Classifier #LightPink {
  [Linear: 512→12]
  [12 Disease Classes]
}

Input --> ResNet : Parallel Processing
Input --> EfficientNet : Parallel Processing

ResNet --> Fusion : 2048 features
EfficientNet --> Fusion : 1280 features

Fusion --> Classifier : 512 features

note right of ResNet
  **ResNet50:**
  - Pre-trained on ImageNet
  - 4 residual layers
  - 2048 output features
end note

note right of EfficientNet
  **EfficientNet-B0:**
  - Pre-trained on ImageNet
  - 7 MBConv blocks
  - 1280 output features
end note

note right of Fusion
  **Fusion Strategy:**
  1. Concatenate features
  2. Project to 512-dim
  3. Normalize & Regularize
end note

@enduml


